==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmaːlən/|lang=nl}}
* {{rhymes|aːlən|lang=nl}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|malen|lang=dum}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{m|odt|*malan}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{m|gem-pro|*malaną}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb|maalde|gemalen}}

# to [[grind]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{nl-conj-wk|maal|male|malen}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|malen|lang=dum}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{m|odt|*mālon}}, denominative of {{m|odt|*māl}} ‘spot, stain’ (modern {{term|maal|lang=nl}}). More at {{l|nl|maal}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb|maalde|gemaald}}

# {{context|obsolete|lang=nl}} to [[paint]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{nl-conj-wk|maal|male}}

=====Related terms=====
* [[maal]]

====Noun====
{{head|nl|noun plural form}}

# {{nl-noun form of|pl|maal}}
# {{nl-noun form of|pl|male}}

